            "bookId": "HAG",
            "id": "HAG.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc57999137613db28c5"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAG.1",
        "content": "Asɛm a Otumfoɔ Awurade ka nie: “Monnwene mo akwan ho yie.",
        "reference": "Hagai 1:7",
        "verseNumber": "7",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e3e531092a820bbb117",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAG.1.8",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAG",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc57999137613db2947",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAG",
            "id": "HAG.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc57999137613db28c5"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAG.1",
        "content": "Afei, momforo nkɔ nkokoɔ no atifi, na momfa nnua mmra mmɛsi me fie no. Na mʼani bɛgye ho, na wɔahyɛ me animuonyam.” Saa na Awurade ka.",
        "reference": "Hagai 1:8",
        "verseNumber": "8",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e3e531092a820bbb15c",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAG.1.9",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAG",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc57999137613db2947",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAG",
            "id": "HAG.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc57999137613db28c5"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAG.1",
        "content": "“Mo ani daa bebree so, nanso ɛyɛɛ kakraa bi. Na mode baa fie no, mehu guiɛ. Ɛdeɛn ntira?” Ɛfiri sɛ, “me fie abubu.” Saa na Asafo Awurade ka, “ɛberɛ a mo ani abere resisi mo afie.",
        "reference": "Hagai 1:9",
        "verseNumber": "9",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e3e531092a820bbb1b6",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAG.1.10",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAG",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc57999137613db2947",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAG",
            "id": "HAG.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc57999137613db28c5"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAG.1",
        "content": "Mo enti na ɔsoro akyere ɛbɔ agyina, na asase nso akyere mo mfudeɛ.",
        "reference": "Hagai 1:10",
        "verseNumber": "10",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e3e531092a820bbb1e3",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAG.1.11",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAG",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc57999137613db2947",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAG",
            "id": "HAG.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc57999137613db28c5"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAG.1",
        "content": "Mahyɛ ɔpɛ sɛ ɛnsi mo mfuo ne nkokoɔ so; ɔpɛ a ɛbɛhye mo atokoɔ ne mo bobe ne mo ngo dua ne mo mfudeɛ, ɛbɛyɛ ɔpɛ a ɛbɛsi mo ne mo anantwie mu, na asɛe dwuma biara a mode mo nsa adi.”",
        "reference": "Hagai 1:11",
        "verseNumber": "11",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e3e531092a820bbb210",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAG.1.12",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAG",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc57999137613db2947",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAG",
            "id": "HAG.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc57999137613db28c5"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAG.1",
        "content": "Ɛnna Sealtiel babarima Serubabel, Ɔsɔfopanin Yehosadak babarima Yosua ne Onyankopɔn nkurɔfoɔ nkaeɛ no tiee asɛm a ɛfiri Awurade, wɔn Onyankopɔn, ne Odiyifoɔ Hagai a Awurade, wɔn Onyankopɔn, asoma no no. Na nnipa no de osuro maa Awurade.",
        "reference": "Hagai 1:12",
        "verseNumber": "12",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e3e531092a820bbb24e",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAG.1.13",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAG",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc57999137613db2947",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAG",
            "id": "HAG.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc57999137613db28c5"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAG.1",
        "content": "Na Hagai, Awurade somafoɔ no, de saa asɛm yi a ɛfiri Awurade nkyɛn maa nkurɔfoɔ no: “Meka mo ho.” Saa na Awurade seɛ.",
        "reference": "Hagai 1:13",
        "verseNumber": "13",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e3e531092a820bbb2af",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAG.1.14",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAG",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc57999137613db2947",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAG",
            "id": "HAG.1",
            "number": "1",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc57999137613db28c5"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAG.1",
        "content": "Ɛno enti, Awurade kanyanee Sealtiel babarima Serubabel a ɔyɛ Yuda amrado, Ɔsɔfopanin Yehosadak babarima Yosua ne Onyankopɔn nkurɔfoɔ nkaeɛ no nyinaa. Wɔbɛhyɛɛ wɔn adwuma a ɛwɔ Asafo Awurade, wɔn Onyankopɔn, fie no ase,",
        "reference": "Hagai 1:14",
        "verseNumber": "14",
        "chapterNumber": 1,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e3f531092a820bbb2f3",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAG.1.15",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAG",
        "chapter": {
