            "book": "626b6bc57999137613db28c5"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAG.2",
        "content": "Ɛda a ɛtɔ so aduonu baako wɔ bosome a ɛtɔ so nson no, Awurade de asɛm faa Odiyifoɔ Hagai so sɛ:",
        "reference": "Hagai 2:1",
        "verseNumber": "1",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e3f531092a820bbb46e",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAG.2.2",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAG",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc57999137613db2974",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAG",
            "id": "HAG.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc57999137613db28c5"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAG.2",
        "content": "“Ka yei kyerɛ Sealtiel babarima Serubabel a ɔyɛ Yuda amrado ne Ɔsɔfopanin Yehosadak babarima Yosua ne Onyankopɔn nkurɔfoɔ nkaeɛ a wɔwɔ asase no so hɔ no. Bisa wɔn sɛ,",
        "reference": "Hagai 2:2",
        "verseNumber": "2",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e3f531092a820bbb4cb",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAG.2.3",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAG",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc57999137613db2974",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAG",
            "id": "HAG.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc57999137613db28c5"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAG.2",
        "content": "‘Mo a mo aka yi mu hwan na ɔhunuu saa fie yi animuonyam sɛdeɛ na ɛteɛ kane no? Ɛte mo sɛn ɛnnɛ? Ɛnyɛ mo sɛ ɛnsɛ hwee seesei anaa?",
        "reference": "Hagai 2:3",
        "verseNumber": "3",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e3f531092a820bbb538",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAG.2.4",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAG",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc57999137613db2974",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAG",
            "id": "HAG.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc57999137613db28c5"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAG.2",
        "content": "Enti, Serubabel, nya akokoɔduru seesei.’ Saa na Awurade seɛ, ‘Ɔsɔfopanin Yehosadak babarima Yosua, nya akokoɔduru. Mo nnipa a mowɔ asase no so seesei no, monnya akokoɔduru. Awurade na ɔseɛ. Monnya akokoɔduru na monnyɛ adwuma, ɛfiri sɛ, meka mo ho.’ Saa na Asafo Awurade ka.",
        "reference": "Hagai 2:4",
        "verseNumber": "4",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e3f531092a820bbb598",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAG.2.5",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAG",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc57999137613db2974",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAG",
            "id": "HAG.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc57999137613db28c5"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAG.2",
        "content": "‘Yei ne apam a me ne mo yɛeɛ ɛberɛ a mofirii Misraim. Me Honhom ka mo ho. Ɛno enti monnsuro.’",
        "reference": "Hagai 2:5",
        "verseNumber": "5",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e3f531092a820bbb5fb",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAG.2.6",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAG",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc57999137613db2974",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAG",
            "id": "HAG.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc57999137613db28c5"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAG.2",
        "content": "“Yei ne asɛm a Asafo Awurade seɛ. ‘Ɛrenkyɛre biara, mɛwoso ɔsoro ne asase bio. Mɛwoso ɛpo hahanaa ne asase kesee nso.",
        "reference": "Hagai 2:6",
        "verseNumber": "6",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e40531092a820bbb650",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAG.2.7",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAG",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc57999137613db2974",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAG",
            "id": "HAG.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc57999137613db28c5"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAG.2",
        "content": "Mɛwoso aman nyinaa, na aman nyinaa anidasoɔ bɛba, na mede animuonyam bɛhyɛ saa fie ha ma.’ Saa na Asafo Awurade seɛ.",
        "reference": "Hagai 2:7",
        "verseNumber": "7",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
