        },
        "chapterId": "HAG.2",
        "content": "‘Dwetɛ no yɛ me dea. Na sikakɔkɔɔ yɛ me dea.’ Sei na Asafo Awurade seɛ.",
        "reference": "Hagai 2:8",
        "verseNumber": "8",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e40531092a820bbb708",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAG.2.9",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAG",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc57999137613db2974",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAG",
            "id": "HAG.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc57999137613db28c5"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAG.2",
        "content": "‘Saa fie yi animuonyam bɛkorɔn asene nʼanimuonyam a atwam no.’ Saa na Asafo Awurade ka. ‘Na mɛma asomdwoeɛ aba ha.’ Me, Asafo Awurade na makasa.”",
        "reference": "Hagai 2:9",
        "verseNumber": "9",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e40531092a820bbb724",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAG.2.10",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAG",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc57999137613db2974",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAG",
            "id": "HAG.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc57999137613db28c5"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAG.2",
        "content": "Ɔhene Dario adedie mfeɛ mmienu mu, ɔbosome a ɛtɔ so nkron no da a ɛtɔ so aduonu ɛnan, Awurade kaa saa asɛm yi kyerɛɛ Odiyifoɔ Hagai.",
        "reference": "Hagai 2:10",
        "verseNumber": "10",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e40531092a820bbb739",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAG.2.11",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAG",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc57999137613db2974",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAG",
            "id": "HAG.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc57999137613db28c5"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAG.2",
        "content": "“Asɛm a Asafo Awurade ka nie: ‘Mommisa asɔfoɔ no deɛ mmara no ka.",
        "reference": "Hagai 2:11",
        "verseNumber": "11",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e40531092a820bbb784",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAG.2.12",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAG",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc57999137613db2974",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAG",
            "id": "HAG.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc57999137613db28c5"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAG.2",
        "content": "Sɛ ɛnam kronkron bi hyɛ obi atadeɛ mmuano mu, na sɛ ɛho kɔ ka burodo anaa abɔmu, nsã anaa ngo anaa aduane foforɔ bi a, ɛno nso bɛyɛ kronkron anaa?’ ”\n    Asɔfoɔ no buaa sɛ: “Dabi.”",
        "reference": "Hagai 2:12",
        "verseNumber": "12",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e40531092a820bbb7d0",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAG.2.13",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAG",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc57999137613db2974",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAG",
            "id": "HAG.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc57999137613db28c5"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAG.2",
        "content": "Na Hagai bisaa sɛ, “Na sɛ obi nso de ne ho ka efunu de gu ne ho fi, na ɔde ne ho twitwiri nneɛma a wɔabobɔ din yi bi ho a, na wɔagu ho fi anaa?”\n    Na asɔfoɔ no buaa sɛ, “Aane.”",
        "reference": "Hagai 2:13",
        "verseNumber": "13",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e40531092a820bbb7f3",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAG.2.14",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAG",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc57999137613db2974",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAG",
            "id": "HAG.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc57999137613db28c5"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAG.2",
        "content": "Afei, Hagai kaa sɛ, “ ‘Saa ara na nnipa no ne saa ɔman yi teɛ.’ Saa na Awurade seɛ. ‘Biribiara a wɔyɛ ne biribiara a wɔde ba no ho agu fi.",
        "reference": "Hagai 2:14",
        "verseNumber": "14",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e40531092a820bbb829",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAG.2.15",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAG",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc57999137613db2974",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAG",
            "id": "HAG.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc57999137613db28c5"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAG.2",
        "content": "“ ‘Enti, ɛfiri ɛnnɛ, monnwene saa adeɛ yi ho yie. Monkae sɛdeɛ na nneɛma teɛ, ansa na moreto Awurade asɔredan no fapem no.",
        "reference": "Hagai 2:15",
        "verseNumber": "15",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e40531092a820bbb871",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAG.2.16",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAG",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc57999137613db2974",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAG",
            "id": "HAG.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc57999137613db28c5"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAG.2",
        "content": "Ɛberɛ a modwene sɛ mobɛnya mfudeɛ susukora aduonu no, monyaa edu pɛ. Ɛberɛ a mode mo ani buu sɛ mobɛnya gyare aduonum afiri nsakyibea no, monyaa aduonu pɛ.",
        "reference": "Hagai 2:16",
        "verseNumber": "16",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e40531092a820bbb89e",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAG.2.17",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAG",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc57999137613db2974",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAG",
            "id": "HAG.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc57999137613db28c5"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAG.2",
        "content": "Memaa yadeɛ a ɛsɛe mfudeɛ, ɛbɔ ne ampariboɔ bɛsɛee mo nsa ano nnwuma nyinaa. Nanso, moampɛ sɛ mobɛsane aba me nkyɛn. Saa na Awurade seɛ.",
        "reference": "Hagai 2:17",
        "verseNumber": "17",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e40531092a820bbb8c6",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAG.2.18",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAG",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc57999137613db2974",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAG",
            "id": "HAG.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc57999137613db28c5"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAG.2",
        "content": "Ɛfiri ɔbosome a ɛtɔ so nkron, da a ɛtɔ so aduonu ɛnan yi, monnwene da a wɔtoo Awurade asɔredan fapem no ho yie.",
        "reference": "Hagai 2:18",
        "verseNumber": "18",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e41531092a820bbb907",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAG.2.19",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAG",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc57999137613db2974",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAG",
            "id": "HAG.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc57999137613db28c5"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAG.2",
        "content": "Aba bi aka asan no so anaa? Ɛbɛsi ɛnnɛ, bobe, borɔdɔma, ateaa ne ngo dua aso wɔn aba anaa?\n    “ ‘Ɛfiri saa da yi rekorɔ no, mɛhyira mo.’ ”",
        "reference": "Hagai 2:19",
        "verseNumber": "19",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e41531092a820bbb950",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAG.2.20",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAG",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc57999137613db2974",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAG",
            "id": "HAG.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc57999137613db28c5"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAG.2",
        "content": "Awurade asɛm baa Hagai nkyɛn ne mprenu so wɔ ɔbosome no da a ɛtɔ aduonu ɛnan:",
        "reference": "Hagai 2:20",
        "verseNumber": "20",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e41531092a820bbb991",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAG.2.21",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAG",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc57999137613db2974",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAG",
            "id": "HAG.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc57999137613db28c5"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAG.2",
        "content": "“Ka kyerɛ Serubabel a ɔyɛ Yuda amrado no sɛ, merebɛwoso ɔsoro ne asase.",
        "reference": "Hagai 2:21",
        "verseNumber": "21",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e41531092a820bbb9c2",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAG.2.22",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAG",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc57999137613db2974",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAG",
            "id": "HAG.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc57999137613db28c5"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAG.2",
        "content": "Mɛbutu ahennwa, na masɛe ananafoɔ ahemman no tumi. Mɛdane wɔn nteaseɛnam ne wɔn a wɔka no abutu. Apɔnkɔ akafoɔ no bɛhwehwe ase na wɔakunkum wɔn ho.",
        "reference": "Hagai 2:22",
        "verseNumber": "22",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    },
    {
        "_id": "64b58e41531092a820bbba1b",
        "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
        "id": "HAG.2.23",
        "__v": 0,
        "bookId": "HAG",
        "chapter": {
            "_id": "626b6bc57999137613db2974",
            "bibleId": "c97c5e017bdf893c-01",
            "bookId": "HAG",
            "id": "HAG.2",
            "number": "2",
            "__v": 0,
            "bible": "626b389679991376135363f7",
            "book": "626b6bc57999137613db28c5"
        },
        "chapterId": "HAG.2",
        "content": "“ ‘Ɛda no’ Asafo Awurade ka sɛ, ‘Mɛfa wo, Sealtiel babarima, me ɔsomfoɔ Serubabel, mɛfa wo sɛ nsɔano kawa, ɛfiri sɛ mayi wo.’ Me Asafo Awurade, na makasa.”",
        "reference": "Hagai 2:23",
        "verseNumber": "23",
        "chapterNumber": 2,
        "chapterAudioUrl": null
    }
]